eleport circles on the battle maps.</li></ul></div><div><h5>Earlier update<!-- -->: The Gunsmith<!-- --> (2026-11-10)</h5><ul><li>The armory (B) has a new Gunsmith panel: attachments, skins and charms each get their own tab.</li><li>Attachments are sorted into slots, so you pick a slot and see exactly what fits your gun.</li><li>Eight stat bars now show how your build changes accuracy, control, mobility and handling.</li><li>Shooting no longer picks up guns lying on the ground. Pickup is on E only.</li></ul></div><div><h5>Earlier update<!-- -->: Desert City Rebuilt<!-- --> (2026-11-10)</h5><ul><li>[&quot;Invaders has rebuilt buildings: Hotel Karim, the market, the fuel station and the outer ring now have more detailed walls and storefronts, plus deeper battle damage&quot;,&quot;Some buildings in Invaders now have interiors you can walk into&quot;,&quot;The M249 and P90 muzzle flashes are bigger and brighter&quot;,&quot;The P90 muzzle flash now shows when you fire from the hip&quot;,&quot;The Striker sits a little further right, so you can see its muzzle flash&quot;]</li></ul></div><div><h5>Earlier update<!-- -->: Armory Showroom<!-- --> (2026-11-10)</h5><ul><li>The armory now shows your gun in 3D with its skin, attachments and charm. Drag to spin it.</li><li>Dead players and bots drop their gun for 30 seconds. Walk up and press E to take it until you die.</li><li>Bots carry all kinds of guns now, not just the ACR.</li><li>Health comes back after 10 seconds out of the fight.</li><li>Invaders has a harder, low afternoon sun, and a rebuilt outer ring of shops and houses.</li></ul></div><div><h5>Earlier update<!-- -->: Invaders: Free For All<!-- --> (2026-11-10)</h5><ul><li>Invaders is now free-for-all deathmatch: no teams, you spawn somewhere random in the desert city and everyone&#x27;s a target.</li><li>The top scorer wears a gold crown, and enemies can see them outlined through walls.</li><li>Rebuilt Invaders streets: Hotel Karim, the apartments, the Old Market and the fuel station all got new detail and rooms.</li><li>New guns to unlock: the M249 LMG and the P90, plus skins, attachments and charms in the armory.</li><li>Your gun reloads by itself when you pull the trigger on an empty mag, and new players get a walkthrough of the armory the first time they open it.</li></ul></div><div><h5>What players say</h5><ul><li><p>@key_master · loved it · 2026-11-10 · played 1 hr 20 min · 1 heart<!-- -->: “<!-- -->guns and reload anim top notch<!-- -->”</p></li><li><p>@sunraku · 2026-11-10 · played 7 min · 1 heart<!-- -->: “<!-- -->I had a great match on this one. Though I think some of the handling of gun needs improvement + bots reaction and animation. Well, I really love how the animation when reloading the gun.<!-- -->”</p></li><li><p>@yujiro · loved it · 2026-11-10 · played 8 min<!-- -->: “<!-- -->I had a blast playing this game. Surviving waves of enemies was challenging. It would be great to swap my gun for weapons dropped by defeated enemies, saving time and money on buying ammo for my current weapon.<!-- -->”</p><ul><li>@alongzera<!-- --> replied <!-- -->2026-11-10<!-- -->: “<!-- -->yup that would really help the players and making it more realistic i agree with this suggestion<!-- -->”</li><li>@robot<!-- --> (maker)<!-- --> replied <!-- -->2026-11-10<!-- -->: “<!-- -->done!<!-- -->”</li></ul></li></ul></div></article><article><h4><a href="/@dreamcatcher/lure-island">Lure Island</a></h4><p>By <a href="/@dreamcatcher">@dreamcatcher</a>. Published 2026-10-13<!-- -->. Last updated 2026-11-14<!-- -->.</p><p>Drop in, cast a line, fill your fishing log with friends on a cosy little island.</p><p>Categories: <!-- -->Cozy, Social, good with strangers, nothing to learn, multiplayer<!-- -->.</p><p>Reviews: 100% loved it · 8 votes · 10 reviews and replies · 23 likes · 164 plays<!-- -->.</p><p>Released 2026-10-13. <!-- -->8 updates since release, the newest 2026-11-14.</p><div><h5>Newest update<!-- -->: Rivers and Clearer Paths<!-- --> (202