f a good build path for the upgrades. Love the slide movement to pair with this shooter. Incredibly action-packed. Also commend the creativity with the desktop menu and Gary!\",\"”\"]}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"li\",\"44bacf01-fc35-4515-b9d4-5b329506ae3f\",{\"children\":[\"@drift_knight_43\",\" (maker)\",\" replied \",\"2026-11-10\",\": “\",\"\u003c3\",\"”\"]}]],null]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"630728cd-31ed-4c2a-8ad1-20e4a30d2625\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"@sovos · loved it · 2026-11-10 · played 3 hrs 8 min · 1 heart\",\": “\",\"See you on the leaderboards people!\",\"”\"]}],null]}]]}]]}]\n1cc:[\"$\",\"div\",\"cb4a578f-f0c5-4582-b14b-fa4846c7158d\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h5\",null,{\"children\":[\"Earlier update\",\": Chains and Shards\",\" (2026-11-02)\"]}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"A NOTE FROM THE DOCTOR\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"Sorry this update took so long to reach you. It's a big one, and I wanted it right. If anything seems bugged or isn't working the way it should, or if something just feels bad or off, please tell me as soon as you can, in the Vivarium or in Spawn chat. Thank you for playing.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"BOSSES\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"The Taxman: The Collection now drags you in for 3.2s (was 1.2s) and you can't dodge out once the chains lock. The chains then swing for the whole attack in rings that turn in opposite directions, and he walks after you while they spin. Only the swinging chains deal damage; the pull-in deals none. Why: the old pull ended before it read as a threat.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"children\":\"The Taxman: The Tithe, Collection and Ledger each have their own painting now, instead of one sack of coins for everything.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"5\",{\"children\":\"Captain Hollis: A Burning Furrow runs 22m (was 12m). Why: the short furrow was easy to step around.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"6\",{\"children\":\"Court Sorcerer Vex: The Star fires 5 beams (was 6). Why: six beams left no gap you could read.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"7\",{\"children\":\"The Jester: Juggle now throws gas bombs that leave a slowing cloud and mark you Giddy (damage 10 to 6). New move, Cartwheel: he tumbles straight through you. Pratfall now pays off Giddy: FLAT ON YOUR BACK roots you.\"}]]}]]}]\n1cd:[\"$\",\"div\",\"02b63df3-21d5-4e36-819f-cabb79d67484\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h5\",null,{\"children\":[\"Earlier update\",\": Steadier Rot\",\" (2026-10-31)\"]}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"WEAPONS\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"Extra Attacks: now apply to each weapon separately instead of being shared across all of them.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"Plaguethrower: a soldier caught in two or three jets of one puff now takes each jet's full dose and burn.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"Hook and Lighthouse Lantern: Twin Dose adds exactly one more hook or one more beam, instead of repeating the whole volley.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"children\":\"Censer: doses faster, and attack speed now raises its dose rate. Attack speed is counted once (it was being applied twice).\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"5\",{\"children\":\"Censer: the aura is now two painted rings that rotate smoothly around Wikk. Fixed the rings blinking off and stuttering as they turned.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"6\",{\"children\":\"Chalk: the line now lasts 8s. Long Reach now also raises walk speed while holding Chalk.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"7\",{\"children\":\"Lighthouse Lantern: drops every 10s. Attack speed now speeds up the beam's ticks instead of the drop rate.\"}]]}]]}]\n1ce:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h5\",null,{\"children\":\"What players say\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"a3ec5848-47a5-4cae-ad5b-b984f5cd2121\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"@makeriffic · loved it · 2026-11-05 · played 20 min\",\": “\",\"I think the game is fun 