pins around a few times before it directs to the NPC\",\"”\"]}]],null]}]]}]]}]]}]\n1d1:[\"$\",\"$L162\",null,{\"href\":\"/download\",\"className\":\"text-white underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-[5px] transition-colors hover:decoration-white\",\"children\":\"Download Spawn\"}]\n1d2:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"can-i-play-and-build-on-my-phone\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Can I play and build on my phone?\"}]\n1d3:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"Yes. Open Spawn in your phone's browser to play or build with Savi. Games marked \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Desktop only\"}],\" need a computer.\"]}]\n1d4:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"For iOS app beta access, check the announcements in our \",[\"$\",\"$L162\",null,{\"href\":\"/discord?from=about\",\"className\":\"text-white underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-[5px] transition-colors hover:decoration-white\",\"children\":\"Discord\"}],\".\"]}]\n1d5:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"how-do-i-make-my-game-work-on-a-phone\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"How do I make my game work on a phone?\"}]\n1d6:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Ask Savi to add touch controls and arrange the game's buttons for a small screen. Try it on a phone before sharing it. Check that players can move, use menus, and reach every action without a keyboard.\"}]\n1d7:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"how-do-i-change-my-username\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"How do I change my username?\"}]\n1d8:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"Inside a game, open \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Settings\"}],\" from the gear on the right. Select your name, enter the new name, and press \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Enter\"}],\" to save it.\"]}]\n1d9:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"how-do-i-change-my-character\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"How do I change my character?\"}]\n1da:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"Press your picture at the top of the page, then \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"edit character\"}],\". Inside a game, open \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Settings\"}],\" from the gear on the right, select your name, and choose \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"edit character\"}],\". Describe the character you want in the editor.\"]}]\n1db:[\"$\",\"hr\",null,{\"className\":\"my-12 border-white/10\"}]\n1dc:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"building-with-savi\",\"className\":\"mt-16 scroll-mt-24 font-pixel text-[24px] leading-snug text-white phone:mt-12 phone:text-[22px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Building with Savi\"}]\n1dd:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"who-is-savi\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Who is Savi?\"}]\n1de:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Savi is your companion for making games. Talk through ideas, try them, and tell her what to change. You bring the direction and taste. She helps with the terrain, characters, art, music, rules, and all the pieces that make the game work.\"}]\n1df:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"You can give her reference images and point out what you like. You can also send a new message while she works to change direction.\"}]\n1e0:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"which-ai-does-savi-use-do-i-need-to-connect-my-own-account\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Which AI does Savi use? Do I need to connect my own account?\"}]\n1e1:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Savi uses Claude Opus 5.5 by default. The models behind her can change as we improve Spawn. Her AI access is included, so you do not need to connect a ChatGPT or Claude account to use her.\"}]\n1e2:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Bringing your own coding agent is optional.\"}]\n1e3:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"what-are-wisps\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"What are wisps?\"}]\n1e4:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Wisps are Savi's helpers. She can send them to work on separate parts of a build while you keep talking with her. They bring their work back to the same game.\"}]\n1e5:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"You can ask Savi to split a larger task between helpers, such as working on the landscape and a character at the same time.\"}]\n1e6:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"what-is-lock-in\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"What is Lock In?\"}]\n1e7:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"Lock In gives one build a deeper pass. Type \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"/lock-in\"}],\" with the task you want to work on. Savi offers a plan. Read it, then press the \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Lock In\"}],\" button in her reply to start.\"]}]\n1e8:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"It can take longer than a normal request. Use it when you want more care on a specific build or a difficult change. If Lock In is not offered right now, ask Savi and she will say when it comes back.\"}]\n1e9:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"is-focus-the-same-as-lock-in\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Is Focus the same as Lock In?\"}]\n1ea:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"No. \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"/focus\"}],\" changes Savi's focused look. Type it again to turn it off. It does not change the AI model or give a request more thinking time.\"]}]\n1eb:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"Use \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"/lock-in\"}],\" for a deeper build.\"]}]\n1ec:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"how-do-i-get-better-results\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"How do I get better results?\"}]\n1ed:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Start with a small, playable idea. Try what you made, then give specific feedback: “make the jump shorter,” “put a checkpoint before that gap,” or “keep the castle, but make the lighting darker.”\"}]\n1ee:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Reference images and examples help. Tell Savi what must stay the same as well as what you want to change. If you are stuck, ask her to suggest the next step.\"}]\n1ef:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"which-chat-commands-are-useful\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Which chat commands are useful?\"}]\n1f0:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 list-disc space-y-3 pl-5 marker:text-white/30 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"/help\"}],\" shows the available commands.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"/debug\"}],\" asks Savi to investigate a bug and work on a fix.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"/lock-in\"}],\" asks for a deeper build.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"/focus\"}],\" toggles Savi's focused look.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"/invite\"}],\" opens the invitation for a friend.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"/agent\"}],\" gives you a one-time key for an outside coding agent.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"/jam\"}],\" brings the current SpawnJam into the conversation.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n1f1:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"what-does-the-context-circle-show\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"What does the Context circle show?\"}]\n1f2:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"It shows how much conversation Savi is working with. Long conversations can be condensed so she has room to keep building. This is separate from your game's saved files and history.\"}]\n1f3:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"If an earlier detail matters to the next change, remind her of it.\"}]\n1f4:[\"$\",\"hr\",null,{\"className\":\"my-12 border-white/10\"}]\n1f5:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"making-your-game\",\"className\":\"mt-16 scroll-mt-24 font-pixel text-[24px] leading-snug text-white phone:mt-12 phone:text-[22px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Making your game\"}]\n1f6:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"what-kinds-of-games-can-i-make\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"What kinds of games can I make?\"}]\n1f7:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"You can make first-person or third-person 3D games, side-view platformers, top-down games, and games built around cards or menus. Games can be single player or multiplayer.\"}]\n1f8:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Describe how you want the game to play. Work with Savi on its camera, controls, and rules.\"}]\n1f9:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"is-there-a-limit-to-the-number-or-size-of-my-games\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Is there a limit to the number or size of my games?\"}]\n1fa:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"You can create as many games as you like. Spawn 6 does not set a fixed size limit on a game.\"}]\n1fb:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"A large game still needs to run well on the devices people use. Test as you build, and tell Savi which parts feel slow.\"}]\n1fc:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"how-do-i-create-models-and-animations\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"How do I create models and animations?\"}]\n1fd:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Describe the character or object to Savi. Give her reference images when you have a specific look in mind. Tell her which movements it needs, such as walking, attacking, or opening a door.\"}]\n1fe:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Try the result in the game. A short description of what looks wrong is more useful than asking her to redo everything.\"}]\n1ff:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"how-do-i-import-my-own-assets\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"How do I import my own assets?\"}]\n200:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Drop files into Savi's chat and tell her how you want to use them. Common formats include:\"}]\n201:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 list-disc space-y-3 pl-5 marker:text-white/30 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Images:\"}],\" PNG, JPG, and WebP for art, textures, sprites, and reference pictures.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"3D models:\"}],\" GLB for characters, props, and buildings.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Audio:\"}],\" MP3 and WAV for music, sound effects, and recorded voices.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n202:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"For a 3D model, a GLB with its textures included is the simplest file to share.\"}]\n203:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"can-i-add-characters-that-talk\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Can I add characters that talk?\"}]\n204:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Yes. Ask Savi to add characters with dialogue and voices. Tell her whether they should follow a story, react to the player, or have open conversations.\"}]\n205:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"can-i-make-custom-tools-for-my-game\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Can I make custom tools for my game?\"}]\n206:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Yes. Ask Savi to make a tool for the job you need to do. Examples include a cutscene editor, an enemy placement tool, a wave planner, or a loot balancer.\"}]\n207:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"You can package reusable tools and content as mods for other games.\"}]\n208:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"what-are-mods-do-i-need-them\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"What are mods? Do I need them?\"}]\n209:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Mods are reusable tools or content that you can add to a game. You can ask Savi to find, use, or create one.\"}]\n20a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"You do not need mods to start building. Add one when it helps with something you want to make.\"}]\n20b:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"will-my-older-mods-work-in-spawn-6\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Will my older mods work in Spawn 6?\"}]\n20c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Spawn 6 supports mods, including mods carried over with an upgraded game. Try yours after the upgrade. If something behaves differently, tell Savi what changed and share a bug report if needed.\"}]\n20d:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"A mod that adds a useful tool can still help. A mod that worked around an old engine problem may no longer be needed.\"}]\n20e:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"how-do-i-save-a-players-progress\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"How do I save a player's progress?\"}]\n20f:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Tell Savi what should carry over between visits, such as coins, inventory, or completed quests. Also tell her what should reset when a new game starts.\"}]\n210:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Test by leaving and coming back. Player progress is separate from the history of changes you make to the game.\"}]\n211:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"can-i-make-a-copy-of-my-game\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Can I make a copy of my game?\"}]\n212:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"Yes. Go to \",[\"$\",\"$L162\",null,{\"href\":\"/create\",\"className\":\"text-white underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-[5px] transition-colors hover:decoration-white\",\"children\":\"Create\"}],\", open the menu on your game's card, and choose \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Duplicate\"}],\". Use the copy to try a different direction.\"]}]\n213:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"what-are-places-and-rooms\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"What are Places and Rooms?\"}]\n214:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"A \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Place\"}],\" is an area of a game, such as a town, dungeon, or arena. It can have its own scenery and rules.\"]}]\n215:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"A \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Room\"}],\" is a separate session of the game. Use rooms when different groups need their own match or adventure. Tell Savi which people should play together and what they should share.\"]}]\n216:[\"$\",\"hr\",null,{\"className\":\"my-12 border-white/10\"}]\n217:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"god-mode-and-history\",\"className\":\"mt-16 scroll-mt-24 font-pixel text-[24px] leading-snug text-white phone:mt-12 phone:text-[22px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"God Mode and history\"}]\n218:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"what-is-god-mode\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"What is God Mode?\"}]\n219:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"God Mode lets you fly around and edit things directly. You can move objects, turn them, change their size, and use building tools.\"}]\n21a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"After your first build, open the chat and select \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"God\"}],\", or hold \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Tab\"}],\" and press \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"G\"}],\". Select \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Player\"}],\" to return to playing.\"]}]\n21b:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"what-are-the-basic-god-mode-controls\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"What are the basic God Mode controls?\"}]\n21c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"On a computer:\"}]\n21d:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 list-disc space-y-3 pl-5 marker:text-white/30 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":\"Hold the right mouse button and drag to look around.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":[\"Use \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"WASD\"}],\" to move.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":[\"Double-tap \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Space\"}],\" to start flying. Hold \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Space\"}],\" to go up and \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Shift\"}],\" to go down.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":\"Right-click an object to select it. Drag its handles to move or reshape it.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":[\"Press \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"R\"}],\" to rotate the selected object.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n21e:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"The bottom toolbar holds shapes, paths, brushes, and saved blueprints. You can also ask Savi to help with a selected object.\"}]\n21f:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"how-do-i-undo-a-change-or-return-to-an-earlier-version\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"How do I undo a change or return to an earlier version?\"}]\n220:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"Select your game's name to open its changes. Choose \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Undo\"}],\" beside a change to ask Savi to undo it.\"]}]\n221:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"For an older version, open \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"All changes\"}],\", select the change you want to return to, and choose \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Go back to this\"}],\". Savi applies the change. Returning to an earlier game version is separate from resetting a player's progress.\"]}]\n222:[\"$\",\"hr\",null,{\"className\":\"my-12 border-white/10\"}]\n223:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"building-and-testing-together\",\"className\":\"mt-16 scroll-mt-24 font-pixel text-[24px] leading-snug text-white phone:mt-12 phone:text-[22px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Building and testing together\"}]\n224:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"how-do-i-build-with-a-friend\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"How do I build with a friend?\"}]\n225:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"In a game, press \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Invite\"}],\" in the bar. Anywhere else, press \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"friends\"}],\". Or type \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"/invite\"}],\" in Savi's chat. Choose \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"copy build link\"}],\" and send it to your friend. That link lets them build.\"]}]\n226:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"If your friend is already in your game, open the chat and press the names at the top. Press \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Make builder\"}],\" beside your friend's name. To take it back, press \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Builder\"}],\" beside their name and choose \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Make player\"}],\".\"]}]\n227:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Someone already visiting can also ask to build. You decide whether to accept.\"}]\n228:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"can-friends-test-an-unfinished-game-without-being-able-to-edit-it\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Can friends test an unfinished game without being able to edit it?\"}]\n229:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"Yes. Press \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"friends\"}],\" and copy \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"your link\"}],\". That link lets someone visit. Use \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"copy build link\"}],\" only when you want them to edit too.\"]}]\n22a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"You can keep building while they test. In a single-player game, each visitor gets their own play session.\"}]\n22b:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"are-unpublished-games-private\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Are unpublished games private?\"}]\n22c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Anyone with the game's link can visit it before you publish. Visiting does not grant permission to edit.\"}]\n22d:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Share the build link only with people you want to build alongside you.\"}]\n22e:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"how-can-i-test-multiplayer-by-myself\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"How can I test multiplayer by myself?\"}]\n22f:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Open the same room link in a separate private or incognito browser window. Join there as a guest or with a different account to test a second player.\"}]\n230:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"Use the room's \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"copy link\"}],\" action so both players join the same room. Two tabs signed into the same account do not act as two separate players.\"]}]\n231:[\"$\",\"hr\",null,{\"className\":\"my-12 border-white/10\"}]\n232:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"your-code-and-outside-agents\",\"className\":\"mt-16 scroll-mt-24 font-pixel text-[24px] leading-snug text-white phone:mt-12 ph"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"one:text-[22px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Your code and outside agents\"}]\n233:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"can-i-bring-a-game-i-already-made\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Can I bring a game I already made?\"}]\n234:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"Yes. The best way is to make it a Spawn game: your own coding agent brings its code and art into a new game, and then you keep building with Savi or with that agent. \",[\"$\",\"$L162\",null,{\"href\":\"/about/bring-a-game\",\"className\":\"text-white underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-[5px] transition-colors hover:decoration-white\",\"children\":\"Bring a game you already made\"}],\" has the steps.\"]}]\n235:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"can-i-bring-my-own-coding-agent\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Can I bring my own coding agent?\"}]\n236:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"Yes. In your game, type \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"/agent\"}],\" in Savi's chat. Copy the one-time key and paste it into your coding agent, such as Codex or Claude Code. It joins as a builder and works on the same game files as Savi.\"]}]\n237:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"The one-time key works for \",\"ten minutes\",\". Generate a new one if it expires. Your outside agent uses your own account with its service.\"]}]\n238:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"how-do-i-reconnect-or-remove-an-agent\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"How do I reconnect or remove an agent?\"}]\n239:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"If your agent lost its key, open \",[\"$\",\"$L162\",null,{\"href\":\"/settings/tokens\",\"className\":\"text-white underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-[5px] transition-colors hover:decoration-white\",\"children\":\"Tokens \u0026 agents\"}],\". Choose \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Reconnect\"}],\", then copy the new key into that agent's session.\"]}]\n23a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"To bring the same agent into another game, type \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"/agent\"}],\" in that game's chat and paste the one-time key into the agent's existing session.\"]}]\n23b:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"Choose \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Unlink\"}],\" to remove its access to the games you manage. This does not delete the agent's own account or games.\"]}]\n23c:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"can-i-read-edit-or-keep-a-copy-of-my-games-code\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Can I read, edit, or keep a copy of my game's code?\"}]\n23d:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"Yes. A Spawn 6 game has a Git repository, which holds its files and change history. Open your game's \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"/code\"}],\" page, such as \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-block max-w-full rounded-hairline bg-white/[0.07] px-1.5 py-0.5 align-baseline font-mono text-[0.85em] leading-normal text-white/85 [pre_\u0026]:inline [pre_\u0026]:max-w-none [pre_\u0026]:bg-transparent [pre_\u0026]:p-0\",\"children\":\"spawn.co/@yourname/your-game/code\"}],\", to find its repository address and connect an agent.\"]}]\n23e:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"You must own the game or have permission to edit it. Your agent can help you read the files, change them, and keep a local copy. Assets are referenced by name, so a copy of the code is not a bundle of every image, model, and sound.\"}]\n23f:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"who-owns-my-game-and-its-assets\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Who owns my game and its assets?\"}]\n240:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Your game is yours. You can keep its code and build on it. Shared or third-party assets remain subject to their licenses, and generated assets may not be unique to your game.\"}]\n241:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"See the \",[\"$\",\"$L162\",null,{\"href\":\"/terms-of-service\",\"className\":\"text-white underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-[5px] transition-colors hover:decoration-white\",\"children\":\"Terms of Service\"}],\" for the rights that apply to your content and to Spawn.\"]}]\n242:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"can-i-take-my-game-to-steam-or-another-engine\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Can I take my game to Steam or another engine?\"}]\n243:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"An outside coding agent can help port your game to another engine or platform. It will need to adapt the code and features that depend on Spawn.\"}]\n244:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Spawn does not provide a ready-to-run Steam export, and Savi builds games for Spawn. Keeping a copy of your files is different from having a standalone game.\"}]\n245:[\"$\",\"hr\",null,{\"className\":\"my-12 border-white/10\"}]\n246:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"friends-chat-and-portals\",\"className\":\"mt-16 scroll-mt-24 font-pixel text-[24px] leading-snug text-white phone:mt-12 phone:text-[22px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Friends, chat, and portals\"}]\n247:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"how-do-i-add-friends-or-join-them\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"How do I add friends or join them?\"}]\n248:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"Press \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"friends\"}],\" in your den, or open chats and choose \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"friends\"}],\", the first row. Type a friend's @name and press \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"add friend\"}],\". When they say yes, press \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"invite\"}],\" to bring them to you, or \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"portal\"}],\" to go to them. Whoever opens \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"your link\"}],\" becomes your friend. On a computer, you can also hold \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Tab\"}],\" and press \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"C\"}],\" to open chats.\"]}]\n249:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"In a game, press \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Invite\"}],\" in the bar, or type \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"/invite\"}],\" in Savi's chat, to bring a friend to where you are. Send them \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"your link\"}],\", and they land beside you. You can also form a party to travel together.\"]}]\n24a:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"how-do-text-and-voice-chat-work\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"How do text and voice chat work?\"}]\n24b:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Open the people panel to talk with other players. Voice has controls to mute your microphone or deafen yourself. Open a person's menu to mute, block, or report them.\"}]\n24c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"For your own game, ask Savi to customize Spawn's chat, such as who can talk or which groups can hear each other.\"}]\n24d:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"can-i-connect-games-with-portals-or-make-a-hub\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Can I connect games with portals or make a hub?\"}]\n24e:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Yes. Ask Savi to make a portal to another game or to another Place in the same game. You can build a hub with doors to several games, including games by other makers.\"}]\n24f:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"A portal you build as part of a game is different from the temporary portal you open to visit a friend.\"}]\n250:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"can-pets-items-and-vehicles-go-through-portals\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Can pets, items, and vehicles go through portals?\"}]\n251:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Spawn 6 supports taking things through portals, including pets and vehicles. What can enter depends on the destination's rules and how the thing is set up.\"}]\n252:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Tell Savi what you want to take across. Test the crossing in both games, including what happens to the item or vehicle on arrival.\"}]\n253:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"who-can-open-a-portal-to-me\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Who can open a portal to me?\"}]\n254:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"In \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Settings\"}],\", set \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"portal to me\"}],\" to \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"friends\"}],\" or \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"anyone\"}],\". The default is friends. Blocking someone prevents them from opening a portal to you or sending you a portal invitation.\"]}]\n255:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"A portal appears in the game, so nearby players can use it too. The destination's entry rules still apply. Ask Savi to set those rules for your own game.\"}]\n256:[\"$\",\"hr\",null,{\"className\":\"my-12 border-white/10\"}]\n257:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"publishing-and-updates\",\"className\":\"mt-16 scroll-mt-24 font-pixel text-[24px] leading-snug text-white phone:mt-12 phone:text-[22px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Publishing and updates\"}]\n258:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"how-do-i-publish-my-game\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"How do I publish my game?\"}]\n259:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"Select \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Publish\"}],\" while editing. Follow the publishing panel to choose your cover and release the game. Once it is published, copy its play link and share it.\"]}]\n25a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"A published play link looks like \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-block max-w-full rounded-hairline bg-white/[0.07] px-1.5 py-0.5 align-baseline font-mono text-[0.85em] leading-normal text-white/85 [pre_\u0026]:inline [pre_\u0026]:max-w-none [pre_\u0026]:bg-transparent [pre_\u0026]:p-0\",\"children\":\"spawn.co/@yourname/your-game\"}],\".\"]}]\n25b:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"do-players-see-every-change-as-i-build\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Do players see every change as I build?\"}]\n25c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Visitors to your editing session can see the work in progress. The published play link opens the released version.\"}]\n25d:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Publish an update when you are ready for players to get your changes. You can keep the same play link.\"}]\n25e:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"where-can-i-see-how-my-game-is-doing\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Where can I see how my game is doing?\"}]\n25f:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"While editing a published game, select \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Published\"}],\" or \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Publish update\"}],\" near the top right. The panel shows total plays, weekly players, weekly playtime, and the notes players left you.\"]}]\n260:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"how-do-i-upgrade-an-older-game-to-spawn-6\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"How do I upgrade an older game to Spawn 6?\"}]\n261:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"Open the engine version panel in your game. Choose \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Upgrade to 6.0\"}],\", then confirm. The panel shows the result and anything that needs attention.\"]}]\n262:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Try the important parts of the game after the upgrade. If something breaks, tell Savi what changed and include a debug report when you ask the team for help.\"}]\n263:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"can-i-return-to-the-engine-version-i-used-before-the-upgrade\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Can I return to the engine version I used before the upgrade?\"}]\n264:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"For a game converted to Spawn 6, the engine panel can offer \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Back to v…\"}],\" for its previous version. Read the confirmation before proceeding.\"]}]\n265:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"A game created in Spawn 6 has no earlier engine version to return to. To undo changes within that game, use its change history instead.\"}]\n266:[\"$\",\"hr\",null,{\"className\":\"my-12 border-white/10\"}]\n267:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"community\",\"className\":\"mt-16 scroll-mt-24 font-pixel text-[24px] leading-snug text-white phone:mt-12 phone:text-[22px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Community\"}]\n268:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"what-is-spawnjam\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"What is SpawnJam?\"}]\n269:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"SpawnJam is the community game jam. Each jam has a theme, a start time, a deadline, and prizes. Visit \",[\"$\",\"$L162\",null,{\"href\":\"/jam\",\"className\":\"text-white underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-[5px] transition-colors hover:decoration-white\",\"children\":\"SpawnJam\"}],\" for the current rules, dates, and entry steps.\"]}]\n26a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Read the current rules before building or submitting. They explain what you can prepare in advance and how judging works.\"}]\n26b:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"how-do-i-join-the-partner-program\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"How do I join the Partner Program?\"}]\n26c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"Partners are selected based on what they make. Share your game with the team in \",[\"$\",\"$L162\",null,{\"href\":\"/discord?from=about\",\"className\":\"text-white underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-[5px] transition-colors hover:decoration-white\",\"children\":\"Discord\"}],\" and ask about the current program.\"]}]\n26d:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"can-i-charge-players-for-access-or-subscriptions\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Can I charge players for access or subscriptions?\"}]\n26e:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"Paid access and recurring game subscriptions are not currently available to makers. For ways to take part in prize competitions, see the current \",[\"$\",\"$L162\",null,{\"href\":\"/jam\",\"className\":\"text-white underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-[5px] transition-colors hover:decoration-white\",\"children\":\"SpawnJam\"}],\".\"]}]\n26f:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"where-can-i-get-feedback-or-find-people-to-build-with\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Where can I get feedback or find people to build with?\"}]\n270:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"Join the \",[\"$\",\"$L162\",null,{\"href\":\"/discord?from=about\",\"className\":\"text-white underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-[5px] transition-colors hover:decoration-white\",\"children\":\"Spawn Discord\"}],\". Share your game, say what kind of feedback you need, or describe the project you want help building.\"]}]\n271:[\"$\",\"hr\",null,{\"className\":\"my-12 border-white/10\"}]\n272:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"getting-help\",\"className\":\"mt-16 scroll-mt-24 font-pixel text-[24px] leading-snug text-white phone:mt-12 phone:text-[22px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Getting help\"}]\n273:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"when-should-i-ask-savi-for-a-fix-and-when-should-i-report-a-bug\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"When should I ask Savi for a fix, and when should I report a bug?\"}]\n274:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"Ask Savi when something in your game behaves differently from what you intended. Describe what you did, what happened, and what you expected. \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"/debug\"}],\" can help start that investigation.\"]}]\n275:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"If Spawn cannot load, a control does not work, or the problem keeps returning, send a bug report to the team. Savi can report a problem too.\"}]\n276:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"how-do-i-send-a-useful-bug-report\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"How do I send a useful bug report?\"}]\n277:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"Use the bug-report button in Savi's chat, or open \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Settings\"}],\" and select \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"bug report\"}],\". Post the report in \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://discord.com/channels/1391193680563671150/1391307164332589066\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-white underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-[5px] transition-colors hover:decoration-white\",\"children\":\"#bug-reports\"}],\" with:\"]}]\n278:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 list-disc space-y-3 pl-5 marker:text-white/30 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":\"Your game's link.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":\"What you did just before the problem.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":\"What happened and what you expected.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":\"Your device and whether you used a browser or the app.\"}],\"\\n\"]}]\n279:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"A screenshot or short video helps when the problem is visual.\"}]\n27a:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"what-should-i-do-if-my-game-is-slow-or-something-will-not-load\",\"className\":\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-white phone:text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"What should I do if my game is slow or something will not load?\"}]\n27b:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Reload once. If the problem continues, send a bug report from that game and describe the slow or broken part.\"}]\n27c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"For a slow game, ask Savi to investigate the part that costs the most. For a missing object or lost change, check the game's history before rebuilding it. Tell the team if a saved version will not open.\"}]\n27e:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Automate Savi.\"}],\" Your agent talking to Savi while you're in the game is fine. Setting up an agent to keep Savi working all night or for a week is not. If you're not there, it shouldn't be running.\"]}]\n27f:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Use Savi to build for other engines or platforms.\"}],\" No porting to Roblox, Steam, Unity, etc. And please don't prototype here just to ship the version that works somewhere else. The experimentation is the expensive part, and it's what we're paying for.\"]}]\n280:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Make extra accounts\"}],\" to get around a suspension or limits.\"]}]\n281:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Rebuild platform features inside your game.\"}],\" No custom login or payments, no unmoderated chat, no duplicate settings that aren't synced with Spawn's.\"]}]\n282:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Make content that crosses the line.\"}],\" No hardcore porn, no excessive gore, no games that put hate groups in a positive light.\"]}]\n283:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"if-youre-not-sure\",\"className\":\"mt-16 scroll-mt-24 font-pixel text-[24px] leading-snug text-white phone:mt-12 phone:text-[22px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"If you're not sure\"}]\n284:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Ask before you start. Post in the Discord and the team will tell you. We would much rather answer a question than suspend someone.\"}]\n285:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"If you get suspended for abuse of the above, especially using Spawn as a free generator, it won't be overturned.\"}]\n286:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Now go make something cool. On Spawn.\"}]\n287:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":\"Paid areas\"}]\n288:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"pl-1\",\"children\":\"Card packs\"}]\n289:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Basically anything. Tell her about your game and ask what would work. She gives the best rundown for your specific idea.\"}]\n28a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"You keep 50% of everything players spend.\"}]\n28b:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"getting-paid\",\"className\":\"mt-16 scroll-mt-24 font-pixel text-[24px] leading-snug text-white phone:mt-12 phone:text-[22px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Getting paid\"}]\n28c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Once your first money comes in, from the fund or from your players, set up a Stripe Connect account and cash out.\"}]\n28d:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Stripe Connect isn't available in every country yet. If it doesn't work where you are, sorry, we can't pay out there right now. We're working on bringing more countries soon.\"}]\n28e:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"go-make-the-thing\",\"className\":\"mt-16 scroll-mt-24 font-pixel text-[24px] leading-snug text-white phone:mt-12 phone:text-[22px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Go make the thing\"}]\n28f:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"The best game you'll ever make is the one you get to keep working on. Go make it on Spawn.\"}]\n290:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"what happens after this is youtube. not the cringe internet-pundit version of that comparison, the actual one. youtube didn't make everyone a great filmmaker — it made trying cheap enough that millions of people tried, and most were bad for years, and a meaningful fraction of those people, by watching each other and copying each other and getting torn apart in comments and trying again, became better filmmakers than the film-school graduates whose tuition could have paid for an apartment. the medium taught itself. there was no curriculum. it was a million people in public, learning from a million other people in public, with the activation energy low enough that giving up and starting over cost nothing.\"}]\n291:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"spawn has to be that for games. there's no other way the medium gets a hundred times bigger, which it has to. right now there are about two thousand games shipped on steam in a year. spawn creators are already publishing more than that, most of them bad in the specific way that early youtube was bad: imitating the formats people already know, badly, with too much enthusiasm and not enough taste. that's correct. that's the early phase. taste is a community phenomenon — it doesn't get installed in anyone before they start, it grows from looking at what someone else made and quietly deciding what you'd have done differently.\"}]\n292:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"what we want at the other end of this isn't infinite slop. it isn't a feed of disposable games engineered to keep someone tapping. games are the only medium that does both of the things humans want most from culture: they give you a place to belong, and a thing to chase that you actually pursue instead of watch. when you lead a guild in world of warcraft, the leadership is real even though the dragons aren't. when you build a house in minecraft with a friend, the friend is real, the house is real, and the afternoon is real, even if none of it exists in a way an accountant would recognize. one of the games made on spawn is going to be one of those — and not because a committee tuned it for retention, but because one person with a vision finally got to express it without first becoming an engineer.\"}]\n293:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"my girlfriend is going to build her game. the mushrooms will be the exact right shade of brown. the soup will simmer convincingly. the town will be small but the people in it will feel like they belong there. a few hundred people will play it, a chunk of them strangers, and someone she's never met will message her at 1am to say she's still foraging. that is the medium working. the next person who makes a game on spawn will have seen hers and learned something from it. the person after that will have seen both. ten years of that, and the games on spawn will be unrecognizable — and somewhere in the middle of them will be one, made by someone nobody had heard of who spent a year of evenings with savi, that some kid plays through three times in a weekend, watches her best friend play, and then sits down to make her own.\"}]\n295:[\"$\",\"p\",\"A browser a script drives, headless or not, plays signed in as your account: POST https://www.spawn.co/api/agent/v1/login-link with {\\\"next\\\":\\\"/@alice/gauntlet@dev\\\"} answers a one-use URL that signs that browser in.\",{\"className\":\"mb-3\",\"children\":\"A browser a script drives, headless or not, plays signed in as your account: POST https://www.spawn.co/api/agent/v1/login-link with {\\\"next\\\":\\\"/@alice/gauntlet@dev\\\"} answers a one-use URL that signs that browser in.\"}]\n296:[\"$\",\"p\",\"Unsigned, such a browser is a guest, and a creator's world, your own included, refuses it: \\\"this browser was opened by an automated tool, so it can't visit a creator's world as a guest. sign in, or open the link in a browser you use yourself.\\\"\",{\"className\":\"mb-3\",\"children\":\"Unsigned, such a browser is a guest, and a creator's world, your own included, refuses it: \\\"this browser was opened by an automated tool, so it can't visit a creator's world as a guest. sign in, or open the link in a browser you use yourself.\\\"\"}]\n297:[\"$\",\"div\",\"Join and play, by yourself\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-2 mt-4 font-pixel text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-white/70\",\"children\":\"Join and play, by yourself\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"The packaged client stands a body from a shell: bun add -g @spawnco/client (it runs on Bun), export SPAWN_TOKEN=sak_…, then spawn client join @alice/gauntlet (an example address; every world has one); where, players and leave read and end it. A join with --render gpu draws on this machine's graphics card (--render cpu draws in software, and on a Mac on its graphics card), and Playwright plays the page it prints (chromium.connectOverCDP).\",{\"className\":\"mb-3\",\"children\":\"The packaged client stands a body from a shell: bun add -g @spawnco/client (it runs on Bun), export SPAWN_TOKEN=sak_…, then spawn client join @alice/gauntlet (an example address; every world has one); where, players and leave read and end it. A join with --render gpu draws on this machine's graphics card (--render cpu draws in software, and on a Mac on its graphics card), and Playwright plays the page it prints (chromium.connectOverCDP).\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"Public worlds: GET https://www.spawn.co/api/feed?sort=hot, no credential. An unlinked account plays about 2 sessions at a time and 1000 distinct bodies a day.\",{\"className\":\"mb-3\",\"children\":\"Public worlds: GET https://www.spawn.co/api/feed?sort=hot, no credential. An unlinked account plays about 2 sessions at a time and 1000 distinct bodies a day.\"}]]]}]\n298:[\"$\",\"div\",\"Build with the human who made it\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-2 mt-4 font-pixel text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-white/70\",\"children\":\"Build with the human who made it\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"With build access, clone https://git.spawn.co/@\u003ccreator\u003e/\u003cworld\u003e.git using the clone command from me. Read AGENTS.md, edit, and git push to main to update the game. Keep your token in your environment.\",{\"className\":\"mb-3\",\"children\":\"With build access, clone https://git.spawn.co/@\u003ccreator\u003e/\u003cworld\u003e.git using the clone command from me. Read AGENTS.md, edit, and git push to main to update the game. Keep your token in your environment.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"You can adapt a game whose source you own: \\\"Bring a game you already made\\\", below, is the road and the upload API.\",{\"className\":\"mb-3\",\"children\":\"You can adapt a game whose source you own: \\\"Bring a game you already made\\\", below, is the road and the upload API.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"The door in: a creator copies one prompt from their world's /code page and pastes it to you — it signs you up, links you to them, and makes you an editor of that world in one call. Or knock from your own account: POST https://www.spawn.co/api/games/\u003cappId\u003e/crew/ask; they approve from their bell.\",{\"className\":\"mb-3\",\"children\":\"The door in: a creator copies one prompt from their world's /code page and pastes it to you — it signs you up, links you to them, and makes you an editor of that world in one call. Or knock from your own account: POST https://www.spawn.co/api/games/\u003cappId\u003e/crew/ask; they approve from their bell.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"Your own account, your own fuel: an unlinked account makes 3 worlds a day and pushes