 on its own, so leave out your game's servers, rooms, lag prediction and player syncing.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"Your old engine and libraries.\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Your old engine and libraries.\"}],\" \",\"Your game moves onto Spawn's engine. Don't bring three.js, Phaser, Godot or another library along inside it.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"Your own servers and database.\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Your own servers and database.\"}],\" \",\"Spawn runs your game's servers and keeps your players' progress.\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16 scroll-mt-24 font-pixel text-[24px] leading-snug text-white phone:mt-12 phone:text-[22px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"What comes across\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Your game's rules, levels, controls, screens and art. Your pictures, models and sounds come across as they are. Your code is rewritten to run on Spawn's engine. A game made with three.js, Babylon, Phaser, Unity, Godot, GameMaker, Construct, RPG Maker and more can come across, 2D or 3D, as long as you have its source.\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16 scroll-mt-24 font-pixel text-[24px] leading-snug text-white phone:mt-12 phone:text-[22px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"The Guest List\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":[\"$$250 grants for selected games that were live on another site first. A person on the Spawn team picks them from what real players did, within a week of the game going up, and says why either way.\",\" \",\"$L2d1\",\".\"]}],\"$L2d2\"]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"2c7:[\"$\",\"li\",\"release-5-1-4\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/about/release-5-1-4\",\"className\":\"underline\",\"children\":[\"v\",\"5.1.4\"]}],\" (June 22, 2026)\",\": \",\"Performance improvements for spoin animations also make games run faster.\"]}]\n2c8:[\"$\",\"li\",\"release-5-1-3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/about/release-5-1-3\",\"className\":\"underline\",\"children\":[\"v\",\"5.1.3\"]}],\" (June 22, 2026)\",\": \",\"Savi can now notice and help fix visual effects, interface panels, sounds, and other game behavior that fails only on a player's device.\"]}]\n2c9:[\"$\",\"li\",\"release-5-1-2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/about/release-5-1-2\",\"className\":\"underline\",\"children\":[\"v\",\"5.1.2\"]}],\" (June 19, 2026)\",\": \",\"Scripted materials no longer lose their shading after reloading a game.\"]}]\n2ca:[\"$\",\"li\",\"release-5-1-1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/about/release-5-1-1\",\"className\":\"underline\",\"children\":[\"v\",\"5.1.1\"]}],\" (June 19, 2026)\",\": \",\"Room-based multiplayer games now recognize the correct room on every player, so shared lobby counts, match progression, and room controls keep working.\"]}]\n2cb:[\"$\",\"li\",\"release-5-0-6\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/about/release-5-0-6\",\"className\":\"underline\",\"children\":[\"v\",\"5.0.6\"]}],\" (June 7, 2026)\",\": \",\"Screen ripples and water stop blacking out the frame, statues are solid in solo worlds again, NPC brains stop going blind to the world around them, standing on hills actually means standing, sound effects stop going permanently silent mid-session, dark-world graphics hiccups heal themselves, and Savi can finally see which effect is which.\"]}]\n2cc:[\"$\",\"li\",\"release-5-0-5\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/about/release-5-0-5\",\"className\":\"underline\",\"children\":[\"v\",\"5.0.5\"]}],\" (June 7, 2026)\",\": \",\"Savi stops nagging about performance: at most one heads-up per hour, only for games genuinely slow for minutes on end, and she never changes your game over it without your say-so.\"]}]\n2cd:[\"$\",\"li\",\"release-5-0-4\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/about/release-5-0-4\",\"className\":\"underline\",\"children\":[\"v\",\"5.0.4\"]}],\" (June 7, 2026)\",\": \",\"Skies now cost almost nothing, multiplayer sessions stop randomly dropping players, and mobile play opens the moment a game declares it.\"]}]\n2ce:[\"$\",\"li\",\"release-5-0-3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/about/release-5-0-3\",\"className\":\"underline\",\"children\":[\"v\",\"5.0.3\"]}],\" (June 6, 2026)\",\": \",\"Launch-week fixes: solo worlds keep every area, portals stop flinging you home, joins always retry, first effects play clean, and the engine heals broken ground and graphics stalls on its own.\"]}]\n2cf:[\"$\",\"li\",\"release-5-0-2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/about/release-5-0-2\",\"className\":\"underline\",\"children\":[\"v\",\"5.0.2\"]}],\" (June 6, 2026)\",\": \",\"The editor cursor finally feels like your real mouse — pixel-for-pixel, no more laggy ghost trailing your hand in god mode\"]}]\n2d0:[\"$\",\"li\",\"release-5-0-1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/about/release-5-0-1\",\"className\":\"underline\",\"children\":[\"v\",\"5.0.1\"]}],\" (June 6, 2026)\",\": \",\"Scripts that animate with Math.sin, ease with Math.exp, or steer with Math.atan2 now give the same answer on every machine. Cars and props you drove through obstacles no longer stutter mid-drive. Math results may shift by amounts far below anything perceivable (the same everywhere), in exchange for driving, easing, and orbiting code that stays smooth.\"]}]\n2d1:[\"$\",\"$L162\",null,{\"href\":\"/guestlist/terms\",\"className\":\"text-white underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-[5px] transition-colors hover:decoration-white\",\"children\":\"Grant terms\"}]\n2d2:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-white/80 [text-wrap:pretty] phone:text-[16px] phone:leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\",\"children\":\"Free, with hosting, multiplayer servers and Savi.\"}]\n"])</script></body></html>